{"t":"Ravenous Madness Quest","s":"ravenous-madness-quest-5eedf","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/2024_09_15_162127668_King_Waver_Hotkey_426062.png","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Ravnous Madness Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Rabid Wolf Quest, Trollwut Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"timealloc\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Est. Length</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">30 minutes</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20Tales\">Tibia Tales</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8<br/>(10 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>Some of Hector's students were undertaking experiments related to geological studies, exploring the deeper recesses of this world. Rabid wolves mangled the students furthest into the cave, when the others started to run towards the entrance. In the end only Hector made it as he was the slowest of all and not very far into the hole.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Rabid Wolf Cave\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Rabid%20Wolf\">Rabid Wolf</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ragged%20Rabid%20Wolf\">Ragged Rabid Wolf</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Cave%20Rat\">Cave Rat</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Trollwut\">Trollwut</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>Knight - <a href=\"#/wiki/Protection%20Amulet\">Protection Amulet</a>\n</p><p>Paladin - 25 x <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Arrow\">Poison Arrow</a> and 25 x <a href=\"#/wiki/Burst%20Arrow\">Burst Arrow</a>\n</p><p>Druid  - 10 x <a href=\"#/wiki/Intense%20Healing%20Rune\">Intense Healing Rune</a>, 10 x <a href=\"#/wiki/Cure%20Poison%20Rune\">Cure Poison Rune</a> and 10 x <a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field%20Rune\">Destroy Field Rune</a>\n</p><p>Sorcerer - 10 x <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Field%20Rune\">Fire Field Rune</a>, 10 x <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Field%20Rune\">Energy Field Rune</a> and 10 x <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Field%20Rune\">Poison Field Rune</a>\n</p><p>Monk - <a href=\"#/wiki/Power%20Ring\">Power Ring</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n<b>Method:</b>\n</p><p>Talk to NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Hector%20The%20Mentor\">Hector the Mentor</a> in the Thais penisula area (here) and take the mission he is offering you. \n</p><p>After taking the mission head down the Rabid Wolf Cave. \n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><img alt=\"2024-09-15 162127668 King Waver Hotkey\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"109\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/2024_09_15_162127668_King_Waver_Hotkey_426062.png\" width=\"106\"/><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\nKill 20 x <a href=\"#/wiki/Rabid%20Wolf\">Rabid Wolf</a> and head back to <a href=\"#/wiki/Hector%20The%20Mentor\">Hector The Mentor</a>. [This step is optional]\n</p><p>After reporting your mission head back into the cave to fight the cause of the rabid disease.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><img alt=\"Ravnous Madness Quest 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"109\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ravnous_Madness_Quest_2_42e876.png\" width=\"106\"/><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><img alt=\"Ravnous Madness Quest 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"109\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ravnous_Madness_Quest_3_ce7084.png\" width=\"106\"/><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><img alt=\"Ravnous Madness Quest 4\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"109\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ravnous_Madness_Quest_4_02eded.png\" width=\"106\"/><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><img alt=\"Ravnous Madness Quest 5\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"109\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ravnous_Madness_Quest_5_c6c457.png\" width=\"106\"/><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><br/>\nYou will encounter one <a href=\"#/wiki/Rabid%20Wolf\">Rabid Wolf</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\nYou will encounter two <a href=\"#/wiki/Cave%20Rat\">Cave Rats</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\nYou will encounter many <a href=\"#/wiki/Cave%20Rat\">Cave Rats</a> and many <a href=\"#/wiki/Rabid%20Wolf\">Rabid Wolf</a>. Opening the chest marked with X will reward you 2x <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Health%20Potion\">Small Health Potion</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\nYou will encounter many <a href=\"#/wiki/Rabid%20Wolf\">Rabid Wolf</a>. If the gate around X is open you also might encounter up to two <a href=\"#/wiki/Ragged%20Rabid%20Wolf\">Ragged Rabid Wolf</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p>After crossing the quest door you will encounter the mini boss <a href=\"#/wiki/Trollwut\">Trollwut</a>. Fight him with all your power! (Note: Killing him while standing inside the quest door will not count and you will have to kill him again.) \n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ravnous Madness Quest 6\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"354\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ravnous_Madness_Quest_6_78a762.png\" width=\"600\"/><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p>After killing <a href=\"#/wiki/Trollwut\">Trollwut</a> head to the north and enter the quest gate. Use the corpse (red circle) to obtain a Maddening Mushroom (Quest Item).\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ravnous Madness Quest 7\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"404\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ravnous_Madness_Quest_7_615f7a.png\" width=\"600\"/><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p>To obtain your vocation bound reward enter the corresponding quest gate: \n</p><p>Blue – <b>Knight</b>: <a href=\"#/wiki/Protection%20Amulet\">Protection Amulet</a>\n</p><p>Purple – <b>Paladin</b>: 25 x <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Arrow\">Poison Arrow</a> and 25 x <a href=\"#/wiki/Burst%20Arrow\">Burst Arrow</a>\n</p><p>Orange – <b>Sorcerer</b>: 10 x <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Field%20Rune\">Fire Field Rune</a>, 10 x <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Field%20Rune\">Energy Field Rune</a> and 10 x <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Field%20Rune\">Poison Field Rune</a>\n</p><p>Green – <b>Druid</b>: 10 x <a href=\"#/wiki/Intense%20Healing%20Rune\">Intense Healing Rune</a>, 10 x <a href=\"#/wiki/Cure%20Poison%20Rune\">Cure Poison Rune</a> and 10 x <a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field%20Rune\">Destroy Field Rune</a>\n</p><p>To complete the Quest report back to <a href=\"#/wiki/Hector%20The%20Mentor\">Hector The Mentor</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32476,32286,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32476, 32286, 7)</a>). He will ask you to bring the Maddening Mushroom to <a href=\"#/wiki/Benjamin\">Benjamin</a> in Thais depot (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32350,32219,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32350, 32219, 7)</a>) so he can send it to the Academy in Edron for further investigations.\n</p></div>","quests":[]}